[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Skill" load_steps=2 format=3]

; Shotgun primary fire — "#00 Buckshot". 9 independent hitscan pellets
; fan within cone_deg; each pellet rolls its own damage and crit. Each
; round consumes 1 ammo. Per-pellet damage is intentionally low — the
; payoff is when 5+ pellets land on a close target and stack into a
; massive single-trigger burst. Pellets that fly past the target still
; spawn impact effects on whatever they hit (wall, secondary enemy).

